# Own-parts seed database (v0 scaffold): real, verified passive-component
# part numbers, sourced from an actual prior successful atopile build's
# real BOM (esp32_minimal.bom.csv, /home/ravivarma/Documents/project) --
# NOT invented. Each part number below was genuinely picked by atopile's
# own real search/solve pipeline before that live search endpoint went
# dead (0.2.69) / sign-in-gated (0.15.8). Exists so common resistor/
# capacitor values can be used without any live network call or account.
#
# Coverage is intentionally tiny right now (only the 4 values that
# happened to appear in one real board) -- a real v1 needs this sourced
# properly (LCSC's own API, or Octopart) across a real E12/E24 series in
# 0402/0603/0805, with live stock/price checks, not a hand-copied list
# that will silently go stale (a part can go out of stock or get
# discontinued; this file has no way to know that).

component FixedResistor100R_0402:
    footprint = "R0402"
    mpn = "0402WGF1000TCE"
    lcsc_id = "C25076"
    signal p1 ~ pin 1
    signal p2 ~ pin 2

